  "problem": "Find the acute angle between the vectors\n $v=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{7} \\\\ 7 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$ and $w=[\\begin{aligned}-\\sqrt{7} \\\\ 3 \\\\ 7 \\\\ \\text{\u00a0}4\\end{aligned}].$",
  "worked_solution": "Using the formula\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\theta =\\frac{v\\cdot w}{\u2016v\u2016\\,\u2016w\u2016},\n$$\n\nwe have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\theta  & =\\frac{{v}_{1}{w}_{1}+{v}_{2}{w}_{2}+{v}_{3}{w}_{3}+{v}_{4}{w}_{4}}{\\sqrt{{v}_{1}^{2}+{v}_{2}^{2}+{v}_{3}^{2}+{v}_{4}^{2}}\\,\\sqrt{{w}_{1}^{2}+{w}_{2}^{2}+{w}_{3}^{2}+{w}_{4}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{7}\\cdot (-\\sqrt{7})+7\\cdot 3+2\\cdot 7+2\\cdot 4}{\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{7})^{2}+{7}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{2}^{2}}\\sqrt{(-\\sqrt{7})^{2}+{3}^{2}+{7}^{2}+{4}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{36}{\\sqrt{64}\\sqrt{81}} \\\\  & =\\frac{36}{72} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}\u2061(\\frac{1}{2})=\\frac{\\pi }{3}.\n$$",
